+  `Duration`, `ContinuousClock`, `.scrollContentBackground`) and neither is
+  part of the renderer. The library's own two iOS 16 entry points stay
+  guarded (`@available(iOS 16.0)` on the table's edit menu, `#available(iOS
+  17)` on a symbol). Its dependencies were already pinned for other targets,
+  so it adds no pin; `Licenses/MarkdownView` carries the notice. README.md
