+## CPU Coverage from iOS and iPadOS 15
+
+The oldest supported **iPhone** CPU is A9 (iPhone 6s); the oldest supported
+**iPad** CPU is A8X (iPad Air 2). iPadOS 15 still runs the fifth-generation
+iPad and the first iPad Pro. The following groups therefore cover the entire
+supported floor, including chips that cannot run an unmodified Apple Silicon
+compiler.
+
+Apelin itself runs on every iOS 15 device: the app's floor is iOS 15.0 and its
+code is guarded for the newer APIs it uses where they exist. The compilers do
+not follow the app's floor — the rows below are instruction-set conclusions,
+and A9–A11 cannot execute the LRCPC instructions in the reviewed toolchains,
+so on those devices Apelin opens, edits and manages projects but cannot build
+with them.
 
 | CPU family | Relevant features | Available Apple CLT base component | Swift CPU compatibility |
 |---|---|---|---|
